{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12422","headline":"送冷朝阳擢第後归金陵觐省 · 钱起","name":"送冷朝阳擢第後归金陵觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莱子昼归今始好，潘园景色夏偏浓。\n夕阳流水吟诗去，明月青山出竹逢。\n兄弟相欢初让果，乡人争贺旧登龙。\n佳期少别俄千里，云树愁看过几重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}